  "description": "Upgrade your 2018-2026 Jeep Wrangler JL 4-Door with these durable running boards, designed for superior rocker panel protection. Crafted from all-steel construction, they offer robust defense while seamlessly combining the functionality of running boards and rocker guards. Perfect for enhancing your Jeep’s performance and style, these running boards provide extra durability and a sleek, rugged look for off-road adventures.\nFeatures\nAnti-Rust Protection: The running boards are coated with a premium powder finish, ensuring excellent rust resistance and long-lasting durability, even in tough weather conditions.\nEasy to Clean: Featuring a geometric plate panel design, these boards minimize mud splashing and are simple to clean, maintaining a neat and tidy appearance.\nPre-Welded Bracket: Designed for quick and hassle-free installation, these running boards come with all necessary pre-welded brackets—no cutting or drilling required.\nErgonomic Drop Step Design: The sleek black and red design includes a 3.5-inch drop step, offering enhanced accessibility and comfort, especially for the elderly and children.\n1-year Warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2018-2026 Jeep Wrangler JL 4 Door.",
